gv-vercel:greenhouse:5980197004.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Vercel:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Vercel is the agentic infrastructure company. We free people and agents to ship what’s next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For more than a decade, Vercel has shaped how the web is built. As the team behind Next.js, v0, and AI SDK, we create products that help builders move from idea to production with speed, security, and exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Now, software is entering a new era, and the next generation of products will not just be used by people. They will be built, extended, and operated by agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We are building the platform for that future, trusted by companies like&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;OpenAI, PayPal, Ramp, Supreme, and millions of developers worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;. Whether you’re building our products, supporting our customers, growing our community, or shaping our story, you’ll help define what comes next.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Media Engineer (Social) to own and grow Vercel’s presence across X, TikTok, Instagram, and LinkedIn.&amp;nbsp;You will move quickly, test ideas in public, and build systems that scale content and distribution. You will shape how developers discover and understand Vercel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day execution across Vercel’s social channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and run a cohesive, cross-platform strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship high-quality content at a high cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test formats, trends, and distribution tactics continuously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to speed up creation, editing, and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build simple systems or scripts to improve publishing and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track performance and adjust quickly based on data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, marketing, and developer relations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn moments in tech, AI, and developer culture into content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve Vercel’s voice and brand across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ years growing social accounts, ideally in tech or startups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong taste and intuition for internet and developer culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear track record of audience growth and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable shipping content daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across formats including video, threads, and visuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with AI tools for content creation and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable building or hacking together tools and workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writing and storytelling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses data to guide decisions and experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus if you have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developer audiences or technical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic coding or scripting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with APIs or automation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal content or social presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fast-growing companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation package, including equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Inclusive Healthcare Package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Learn and Grow - we provide mentorship and send you to events that help you build your network and skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Time Off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We will provide you the gear you need to do your role, and a WFH budget for you to outfit your space as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The San Francisco, CA base pay range for this role is $168,000 - $210,000. Actual salary will be based on job-related skills, experience, and location. Compensation outside of San Francisco may be adjusted based on employee location. The total compensation package may include benefits, equity-based compensation, and eligibility for a company bonus or variable pay program depending on the role. Your recruiter can share more details during the hiring process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vercel is committed to fostering and empowering an inclusive community within our organization. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, gender expression or identity, sexual orientation, national origin, citizenship, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Vercel encourages everyone to apply for our available positions, even if they don&#39;t necessarily check every box on the job description.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;te-floating-button-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

hardyaka-coinbase:greenhouse:7866674.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on the Consumer &amp;amp; Business Advanced Trading team, you&#39;ll architect and deliver Coinbase&#39;s next-generation trading systems for the IntX product, working from Singapore in close collaboration with the Trading team. This team builds the fastest, most reliable crypto trading infrastructure globally. You&#39;ll lead multi-quarter, cross-organizational initiatives that define how millions of customers trade, while mentoring engineers and raising the technical bar across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical vision and architecture for mission-critical trading systems, including order management, execution engines, and reliability infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive multi-quarter projects across multiple engineering teams from design through production delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead system design and code review processes that elevate engineering quality and set standards for the trading stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Management and Design to align product strategy with long-term technical bets and roadmap priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the strategic direction of the trading platform by identifying high-leverage technical initiatives and driving consensus across organizational boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deepen engineering talent across the team by coaching engineers at various levels and developing the next generation of trading infrastructure leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience with demonstrated ownership of large-scale distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on expertise in trading systems (traditional or crypto), with direct experience building or operating order management, execution, market data, or risk management components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading complex, cross-team initiatives from ambiguous problem statements through delivered outcomes, with measurable impact on product or platform reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate product requirements into scalable system designs and communicate technical trade-offs to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with performant backend languages in production trading environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P76880&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt; The target annual &lt;strong&gt;base&lt;/strong&gt; salary for this position can range as detailed below. Total compensation may&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;also include equity and bonus eligibility and benefits (including medical, dental, and vision).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,100 SGD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 4 applications per 30-day period.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Disclosure: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is piloting an AI tool based on machine learning technologies to conduct initial screening interviews to qualified applicants. The tool simulates realistic interview scenarios and engages in dynamic conversation.&amp;nbsp; Coinbase is also piloting an AI interview intelligence platform to transcribe and summarize interview notes, allowing our interviewers to fully focus on you as the candidate. Coinbase will not use AI to make decisions impacting employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

hcvc-alpine-eagle-gmbh:greenhouse:471414.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;429&quot;&gt;At Alpine Eagle, we’re building the future of counter-drone defence. We’re a fast-growing, international deep-tech company working at the intersection of aerospace engineering, defence systems, and machine learning. Our goal: create the world’s first swarm-based, airborne counter-drone system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;431&quot; data-end=&quot;592&quot;&gt;Modern conflicts show how quickly drones are reshaping the battlefield. Threats are rising, and today’s solutions aren’t keeping pace. We’re here to change that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;781&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;Alpine Eagle isn’t just a defence company. It’s a mission. Backed by an international team, strong funding, and a bold vision, we’re looking for people who want to shape the next generation of aerial security and build something that truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;781&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;The Chief of Staff will be the CEO’s trusted partner across strategy and operations, driving high-impact strategic and operational initiatives across our defence drone-tech startup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; How you will make an impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;275&quot; data-end=&quot;394&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;277&quot; data-end=&quot;394&quot;&gt;Drive high-priority strategic and operational projects directly with the founder and CEO, from planning through execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;395&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;397&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;Prepare materials for investors, partners, and government stakeholders, including briefs, analyses, and funding-related documents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;530&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;532&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;Conduct market, competitor, and regulatory research within the defence, aerospace, and dual-use technology sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;650&quot; data-end=&quot;790&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;652&quot; data-end=&quot;790&quot;&gt;Support fundraising activities by coordinating documents, financial models, and timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;906&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;1029&quot;&gt;Coordinate cross-team communication and ensure smooth execution between engineering, operations, and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1030&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1032&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;Work closely with founders on strategic decision-making, data-driven prioritization, and KPI tracking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1139&quot; data-end=&quot;1255&quot;&gt;Assist in preparing pitches, demos, and presentations for customers in defence, security, and government agencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1256&quot; data-end=&quot;1355&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1258&quot; data-end=&quot;1355&quot;&gt;Manage special projects that require technical curiosity, operational discipline, and discretion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; What you need to be successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1382&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1384&quot; data-end=&quot;1439&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1384&quot; data-end=&quot;1416&quot;&gt;Fluency in German and English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1440&quot; data-end=&quot;1570&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1442&quot; data-end=&quot;1570&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Min. 3 years of experience in a start-up tech company, defence-consulting, VC, or a similarly fast-paced environment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1675&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1573&quot; data-end=&quot;1675&quot;&gt;Experience with financial analysis, fundraising support, or investor materials is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1676&quot; data-end=&quot;1819&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1678&quot; data-end=&quot;1819&quot;&gt;Strong interest and prior experience in&amp;nbsp;defence, security, aerospace, robotics, or dual-use technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1820&quot; data-end=&quot;1903&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1822&quot; data-end=&quot;1903&quot;&gt;Ability to navigate sensitive or confidential information with absolute professionalism.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1904&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1906&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;Highly structured working style, strong analytical and problem-solving skills, and an ability to “figure things out” without perfect guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2053&quot; data-end=&quot;2149&quot;&gt;Comfortable working in an early-stage environment with shifting priorities and hands-on tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2150&quot; data-end=&quot;2237&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2152&quot; data-end=&quot;2237&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills internally and externally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Alpine Eagle, you&#39;re not just taking a job - you&#39;re joining a mission.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

hunterpointcapital-mission-healthcare:gr.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mission Healthcare,&amp;nbsp;located in seven states, is the largest home health and hospice company in the western United States. We have a critical mission—to take care of our people. We provide a comprehensive array of services that meet the needs of patients and families across the healthcare continuum. We believe our people, partners, patients and their families deserve care delivered with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;C&lt;/strong&gt;ompassion,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;ccountability,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;R&lt;/strong&gt;espect,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;E&lt;/strong&gt;xcellence and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;S&lt;/strong&gt;ervice&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;(CARES),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Mission Healthcare’s core values. By joining our team, you will have the opportunity to impact patient’s lives daily and grow your career in a culture of collaboration, compassion, and commitment. We are excited to continue to grow our mission family!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mission Healthcare offers competitive benefit packages designed to support the well‑being of our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits Available to All Benefit-Eligible Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) retirement savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mileage reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid vacation, sick leave, and holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Benefits for Employees Regularly Scheduled 30+ Hours per Week:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending &amp;amp; Health Savings Accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability, life, and AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay range: &lt;/strong&gt;$38.00-$42.00 per hour, depending on experience&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule/Shift&lt;/strong&gt;: Part-time working&amp;nbsp;Monday-Friday, 10am-2pm&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory/Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Ventura County&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviews clinical documentation to help determine home health appropriateness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assists in compiling and reporting on clinical metrics shared with community partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracks and updates team members on new hospitalizations, hospital holds and resumptions of care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be self-driven with a high degree of attention to detail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates with patients, families and caregivers regarding home health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinates with physicians and referral sources (as appropriate) regarding home health plans of care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assists in ensuring that patients are seen in a timely manner and works with physicians to receive updated start of care orders when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross trains to provide back-up coverage for scheduling and intake coordination when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with field visits if needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses equipment and supplies effectively and efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participates in personal and professional growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other tasks and responsibilities as assigned.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduate of an accredited practical nurse or vocational nursing program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One (1) year nursing experience in home care, hospice care, institutional hospital or facility care preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently licensed as a licensed practical nurse or licensed vocational nurse in the state of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complies with accepted professional standards and practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates good verbal and written communication, and organization skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be a licensed driver with an automobile that is insured in accordance with state and organization requirements and is in good working order.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess and maintains current BLS CPR Certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;See what Mission has to offer! &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SbsmcGH6O08rEoobpgFGPE7pc_P-1MyS/view?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;Click Here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Mission Healthcare, we believe in fostering an inclusive workplace where diversity is valued and every employee feels respected, accepted, and empowered. We are committed to building a diverse team and creating an environment that promotes equity and belonging.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity &amp;amp; Veteran‑Friendly Employer:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are proud to be an equal‑opportunity employer committed to building inclusive, compassionate healthcare teams. We do not discriminate based on race, color, religion, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, disability, veteran status, or any other legally protected characteristic. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veterans and military spouses are encouraged to apply. As a &lt;strong&gt;veteran‑friendly employer&lt;/strong&gt; and proud participant in the &lt;strong&gt;We Honor Veterans Association&lt;/strong&gt;, we recognize and value the leadership, teamwork, adaptability, and service‑driven experience military‑connected individuals bring to patient‑centered care and healthcare environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility Commitment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We strive to make our hiring process accessible to all. If you require accommodations at any stage of the employment process due to a disability, please do not hesitate to let us know how we can best meet your needs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion Efforts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We continually work to enhance our practices by actively combating discrimination and advancing fairness and inclusivity. We encourage applicants from historically underrepresented groups to apply and join us in our mission to diversify our team and foster an environment where diverse perspectives are embraced, and every employee is given the opportunity to thrive.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Voice Matters:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mission Healthcare values your voice. We believe in maintaining a dialogue about diversity and inclusion within our teams and welcome your perspectives and innovative ideas. Together, we aim to build a workplace that reflects the communities we serve and a culture where everyone belongs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Consent:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;By submitting an application, you acknowledge and consent to receive communications—including emails, phone calls, and text messages—from Mission Healthcare and its recruiters regarding your application and potential employment opportunities. You may opt out of text messages at any time by responding with &quot;STOP&quot;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let Better Growth Come To You!&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

initialized-lob:greenhouse:7886100.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lob was founded in 2013 by technical co-founders with a vision to connect the world one mailbox at a time. Today, we&#39;re transforming the way businesses use direct mail and bringing the power of technology to a traditionally manual channel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our modern logistics and fulfillment engine helps businesses to build and scale high-quality, personalized direct mail programs without the operational burden. As we grow to meet the evolving needs of our customers and expand our product offerings, we’re building a team to shape the future of direct mail.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Lead Product Designer (Contract to hire)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role Type: Individual Contributor + Team Lead&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duration: [6 months / Ongoing]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lob is entering a pivotal new chapter, and we are seeking a visionary Lead Product Designer to scale our product. In this role, you will do more than design features; you will design the systems and UX philosophies that elevate our design org. This is a unique opportunity to take a successful, established company and reimagine its design language for the AI era. You will have the autonomy to challenge old assumptions, and the startup environment to design high-impact features yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging best in class design practices and a deep understanding of JTBD, deliver recommendations that reduce friction across key customer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the customer advocate. Drive roadmap prioritization conversations that stem from both qualitative and quantitative insights into how customers interact with our product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Refine Design Team processes with AI at the core - from initial discovery and wireframing to developer handoff - to improve output quality and lead time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering to account for different use cases and edge cases. Raise healthy tension between UX, product scope, and technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide high-quality, actionable feedback to junior and mid-level designers through structured critique sessions to support design quality and consistency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore AI-first interfaces, including non-linear workflows and proactive system interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct design reviews and QA audits to ensure shipped features meet usability and aesthetic standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure design system components are accessible, tokenized, and modular.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;7+ years of product design experience, with at least 2 years in a leadership capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Expert:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;A proven track record of building and scaling design systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;A portfolio demonstrating sophisticated UI/UX work, but more importantly, the documentation and logic behind the systems you&#39;ve built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship History:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Experience directly coaching other designers and helping them level up their visual and strategic skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;#LI-REMOTE #LI-GD1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;“Lob’s salary ranges are based on market data, relative to our size, industry and stage of growth. Salary is one part of total compensation, which also includes equity, perks and competitive benefits. Salary decisions are based on many factors including geographic location, qualifications for the role, skillset, proficiency and experience level. Lob reasonably expects to pay candidates who are offered roles within the provided salary ranges.”&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;We offer remote working opportunities in AZ, CA, CO, DC, FL, GA, IA, IL, MA, MD, MI, MN, MT, NE, NC, NH, NJ, NV, NY, OH, OR, PA, RI, TN, TX, UT, and WA,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;unless specified otherwise in the job description above.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;If you are looking for a progressive, fun-spirited, and mentally stimulating environment, come join us at Lob!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;Lob is an equal opportunity employer and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.lob.com/blog/power-diversity-starts-data&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;values diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt; of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://www.lob.com/blog/a-commitment-to-diversity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;backgrounds and perspectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt; to cultivate an environment of understanding to have greater impact on our business and customers. We encourage under-represented groups to apply and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or criminal history in accordance with local, state, and/or federal laws, including the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot; href=&quot;https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/Document/FCO%20Art.%2049%20Official%20Notice%20to%20print%202017.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;San Francisco’s Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recent awards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://keep.google.com/u/0/media/v2/1e8T9oEtvbqRcrMcmtMSXLguNCPTDvK9fgYyRHPMut1prD3B1tXfjRFr3o2O1dlQ/1mas8D_M3MtQ6MJEDfG-6yRUXNoeICQQ-q7BzV0N3BOFVMtPtiGQm3VTYWAtzlnE?sz=512&amp;amp;accept=image%2Fgif%2Cimage%2Fjpeg%2Cimage%2Fjpg%2Cimage%2Fpng%2Cimage%2Fwebp&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;NaN&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://builtin.com/awards/remote/2025/best-midsize-places-to-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;#88 on BuiltIn&#39;s Best Remote Midsize Companies to Work For in 2025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;BuiltIn Best Remote Midsize Companies to Work For in 2024&lt;br&gt;BuiltIn Best Midsize Companies to Work For 2022&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

integritypowersearch-flowcode:greenhouse.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Flowcode is the leading offline to online conversion platform, committed to building direct connections between brands and fans. By integrating data-driven design with the latest QR technology, we offer contactless connections that are privacy-compliant, ultra-fast, and designed with intention. Our products enable instant, seamless engagement between the physical and digital worlds. As part of a team driven by innovation and growth, you&#39;ll contribute to initiatives that maintain our position as the preferred provider for over 70% of Fortune 500 companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Creative Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to own the visual identity of everything Flowcode puts in front of the market. You will set the creative bar across every external touchpoint while managing and mentoring a small team of designers. Your scope is wide: from the pixels on flowcode.com to the banners at a live event to the merch in a client’s hands. Your work directly shapes how the world’s biggest brands experience Flowcode.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Brand Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;Define and evolve Flowcode’s visual identity system. Typography, color, layout patterns, component libraries, usage rules. You are the final word on what defines Flowcode and what doesn’t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Digital Experience Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Drive the visual elements of flowcode.com. Translate product narratives and business objectives into high-performing, conversion-oriented web experiences that meet Fortune 500 standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Creative Across Channels: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and systematize assets for social, paid media, and lifecycle email. Build scalable frameworks and templates that enable high-volume, on-brand creative production without sacrificing quality or speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events and IRL Products: &lt;/strong&gt;Design for the physical world. You understand how design translates off-screen and you sweat the production details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Develop the Design Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage and mentor a team of designers. Set direction, prioritize work, and elevate output through structured critiques and hands-on guidance. Operate as a player-coach, balancing individual contribution with team development and craft excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5-8+ years of experience &lt;/strong&gt;in brand design, marketing design, or creative direction within a high-growth SaaS, enterprise tech, or consumer platform environment. Portfolio should show range across web, social, email, print, events, and branded physical products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership experience: &lt;/strong&gt;You have managed and developed designers before. You know how to run effective design reviews, present creative rationale to senior leadership, and maintain quality across a team’s output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand system fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep experience building and scaling design guidelines, component libraries, and template architectures across both digital and physical formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool mastery: &lt;/strong&gt;Expert in Figma. Highly proficient in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, After Effects). Comfortable with motion, light animation, and print production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI design literacy: &lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted creative workflows. You actively use these tools to move faster and you have opinions about where they work and where they don’t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speed without shortcuts: &lt;/strong&gt;You thrive under pressure. You move fast without compromising craft. You know when to push for perfection and when to ship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Flowcode&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Help define a new category at the intersection of offline and online identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape experiences that touch millions of consumers across global brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elite team:&lt;/strong&gt; Work alongside high-caliber operators from the world’s best companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead a mandate with C-level visibility and board-level impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flowcode is not for everyone.&lt;/strong&gt; We hire with a &lt;em&gt;pinhole lens&lt;/em&gt; — only those with the rare combination of intellectual horsepower, execution velocity, and uncompromising drive will thrive here. If you are seeking to operate at the highest levels of performance and impact, we want to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The compensation range for this role is $100,000 - 120,000 plus equity and benefits. The role is expected to be in office 4 days a week&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

ivp-hello-heart:greenhouse:8529661002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Hello Heart:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello Heart is on a mission to make heart attacks a thing of the past.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an AI company focused exclusively on heart health, building a platform that predicts and prevents cardiac events before they happen—identifying risk up to 10 days in advance versus 10 years in traditional clinical models.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is already working at scale. Hello Heart has been shown to reduce inpatient hospital days by 47% and deliver ~$1,800 in annual savings per member.&amp;nbsp;Hello Heart is the cardiac prevention partner to over 80% of large U.S. health plans and serves hundreds of public and private employers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re defining how the #1 cause of death—heart disease—is managed in the AI era. Join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Associate Director, Client Success to lead and grow relationships with our public sector healthcare clients. In this role, you will own strategic accounts end-to-end, driving revenue growth, retention, and long-term partnership value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into our Senior Director of Client Success over the Public Sector team, you will serve as a trusted advisor to executive stakeholders while leading complex account strategies across healthcare systems, payers, and public sector organizations. You will operate at the intersection of commercial growth and client impact, ensuring our solutions deliver measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans to drive revenue growth, client adoption, and market expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own renewals, upsell, and expansion opportunities across assigned high-value accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and pursue new use cases, departments, and service line expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for executive stakeholders, including C-suite, clinical, and procurement leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships and position Hello Heart as a critical partner to client success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead business reviews with senior stakeholders to align on performance, outcomes, and long-term strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex renewal cycles and multi-stakeholder procurement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Clinical, Marketing, and Operations to deliver client outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market feedback and customer insights to inform product and go-to-market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track account performance against key metrics and proactively identify retention risks with mitigation plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 40% to support client engagement and relationship building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated fluency in using AI tools to execute workflows, analyze information, and improve productivity, with the ability to evaluate and refine outputs independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in enterprise sales, strategic account management, or management consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing complex, high-value healthcare accounts across public sector or regulated environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience engaging and influencing C-level healthcare stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of healthcare systems, payers, and public sector healthcare ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing long, multi-stakeholder procurement and renewal cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic thinking, account planning, and revenue ownership capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally in fast-paced, matrixed organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree required; MBA, MPH, or equivalent advanced degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The US base salary range for this full-time position is $160,000.00 to $190,000.00. Salary ranges are determined by role and level. Compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training. Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the salary only, and do not include equity or benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hello Heart has a positive, diverse, and supportive culture - we look for people who are collaborative, creative, and courageous. Oh, and if you want to see some recent evidence of the fun things we do at Hello Heart, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/helloheartapp/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram page&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

